      "clips": [
        {
          "segment_id": "title",
          "type": "title",
          "source_text": "取个中文网名",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-24-choosing-a-chinese-screen-name_title_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:001",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "想一下你的网名？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-24-choosing-a-chinese-screen-name_dialogue_001_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "001",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Jaylen。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-24-choosing-a-chinese-screen-name_dialogue_002_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "002",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "这是英文名，网名最好取中文的，像你哥可以叫“稻草人”。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-24-choosing-a-chinese-screen-name_dialogue_003_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "003",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:004",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Joker大？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-24-choosing-a-chinese-screen-name_dialogue_004_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "004",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:005",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "这是扑克牌里的大王。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-24-choosing-a-chinese-screen-name_dialogue_005_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "005",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:006",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Joker有小丑的意思，小丑有时候是贬义词，就是不好的词。不建议你用。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-24-choosing-a-chinese-screen-name_dialogue_006_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "006",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        }
      ]
    },
